WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.666
- [Narrator:] They went too far.

00:00:03.666 --> 00:00:06.500
- We've made some powerful enemies, Daniel.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:08.250
- CONTROLLED FURY!

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.125
Mrs. Ford, do I have permission...

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.750
to go for it?

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.750
Kill them all, MC/DC.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.916
- God, I love this program.

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.875
- Oh, we’re hugging now.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.791
- [Narrator:] They knew too much.

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:24.250
- [Goodell:] We have one job here in the league.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.625
- To keep the Lions out of the playoffs.

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:29.625
- You told me this draft class was a B at best.

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.250
- The Swift trade, the Gibbs pick?

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.500
I just couldn't see it.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.416
- YOU FOOL!

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:35.875
- [Narrator:] They played too fast.

00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.166
- Hey, keep up that rhythm, kid.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.166
- And you keep playing that sweet...sweet...bruise...

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.375
- [Narrator:] Against all odds.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.375
- He's ready, sir.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.625
A third franchise QB in a row for the Pack.

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.000
- This will surely take down
those disgusting Lions.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.500
- Just give me, like, one second to get it together.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.750
- [Narrator:] One Pride...

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.875
- [Campbell:] Password.

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:56.750
- [Sewell:] Blueberries.

00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:58.541
- Reporting for duty...

00:00:58.541 --> 00:00:59.375
again.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.375
- [Narrator:] on an impossible mission...

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:04.791
- [Phone Voice:] Who’s out to get ya?

00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:07.500
- The refs, the commish, the Pro Bowl voters, everyone drafte-

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.500
- Alright, man. We get it.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.500
- [Narrator:] To restore the roar.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.625
- TONIGHT. WE DINE.

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:13.750
ON RAM!

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.375
DETROIT

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.791
- ...and the surrounding suburbs!

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.375
- VERSUS EVERYBODY!

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.125
- [Narrator:] The Detroit Lions in...

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:24.375
- [Voice:] You stole my legacy, Goff.

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:25.875
- You stole mine first.

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.500
- [Voice:] Hope you don't mind.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.750
I still had the key.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.166
- [crowd cheers]
- [Stafford:] Thank you!

00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:32.750
- [Narrator:] Oh, Detroit fans are giving Stafford a standing ovation.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.750
What class.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:34.375
- [Stafford blows kiss]

00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:39.208
- [Narrator:] They thought he was dead.

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:40.708
- What? No. I've been down the Shore.

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.458
Also, I was on the Jets last year.

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:44.750
- [Narrator:] Forgotten by all.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.958
- You'se all know I won a Super Bowl, right?

00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:49.083
- [Narrator:] Mighty Joe Old

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:50.000
- I'm 38.

